---
import {
  buildIrpefWorkedExamples398,
  buildNotDeterminedExamples398,
  buildVatWorkedExamples398,
  formatEuro398,
  formatPercent398,
} from "../../reference-data/italy/fiscal-examples-398";

const irpefExamples = buildIrpefWorkedExamples398();
const vatExamples = buildVatWorkedExamples398();
const notDetermined = buildNotDeterminedExamples398();
const operationLabel = (operation: string) => operation === "add" ? "IVA aggiunta all'imponibile" : "IVA scorporata dal totale";
---
<section class="fiscal-examples398" aria-labelledby="fiscal-examples398-title" data-fiscal-examples398>
  <h2 id="fiscal-examples398-title">Esempi versionati IVA e IRPEF</h2>
  <p>Ogni esempio dichiara l'anno fiscale, la versione delle regole, la data di verifica e la formula completa: gli importi mostrati sono l'aritmetica che i motori locali hanno eseguito, non un valore copiato da un altro anno.</p>

  <h3>IRPEF nazionale lorda</h3>
  {irpefExamples.map((example) => (
    <article class="fiscal-example398" data-irpef-example398={example.id}>
      <h4>Anno {example.taxYear} — imponibile {formatEuro398(example.taxableIncomeCents)}</h4>
      <p class="fiscal-example-meta398">Versione <code>{example.revisionId}</code> · verificata il <time datetime={example.checkedAt}>{example.checkedAt}</time></p>
      <div class="fiscal-scroll398" role="region" aria-label={`Scomposizione IRPEF ${example.taxYear} su ${formatEuro398(example.taxableIncomeCents)}`} tabindex="0">
        <table>
          <thead><tr><th>Scaglione</th><th>Porzione imponibile</th><th>Aliquota</th><th>Imposta</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody>
            {example.bands.map((band) => (
              <tr data-irpef-band398><td>{band.label}</td><td>{formatEuro398(band.taxableBandCents)}</td>
                <td>{formatPercent398(band.rateBasisPoints)}</td><td>{formatEuro398(band.taxCents)}</td></tr>
            ))}
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
      <p data-irpef-formula398><strong>Formula:</strong> {example.formula}</p>
      <p class="fiscal-example-limit398">{example.limitation}</p>
      <p class="fiscal-example-sources398">Fonte della versione: {example.sourceUrls.map((url, index) => (
        <span>{index > 0 ? " · " : ""}<a href={url} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">documento ufficiale {index + 1}</a></span>
      ))}</p>
    </article>
  ))}

  <h3>IVA — finestra ufficiale dichiarata dall'utente</h3>
  <p>Gli esempi IVA restano dentro la sola finestra in cui la Tabella A ufficiale è provata: <strong>{vatExamples[0]?.window}</strong>. Categoria e data sono scelte dall'utente; il modulo non classifica automaticamente merci o servizi.</p>
  <div class="fiscal-scroll398" role="region" aria-label="Tabella esempi IVA versionati scorrevole" tabindex="0">
    <table>
      <thead><tr><th>Esempio</th><th>Riferimento legale</th><th>Aliquota</th><th>Operazione</th><th>Imponibile</th><th>IVA</th><th>Totale</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        {vatExamples.map((example) => (
          <tr data-vat-example398={example.id} data-vat-rate398={example.ratePercent}>
            <td>{example.transactionDate} — {operationLabel(example.operation)}</td>
            <td>{example.legalReference}</td>
            <td>{formatPercent398(example.ratePercent * 100)}</td>
            <td>{example.operation === "add" ? "aggiunta" : "scorporo"}</td>
            <td>{formatEuro398(example.netCents)}</td>
            <td>{formatEuro398(example.vatCents)}</td>
            <td>{formatEuro398(example.grossCents)}</td>
          </tr>
        ))}
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>
  <ul class="fiscal-example-formulas398">
    {vatExamples.map((example) => (
      <li data-vat-formula398={example.id}><code>{example.formula}</code></li>
    ))}
  </ul>

  <h3>Casi non determinati — nessun calcolo inventato</h3>
  <p>Quando l'anno, la data o le addizionali non hanno una fonte dichiarata, l'esempio resta esplicitamente non determinato e non eredita valori da un altro anno.</p>
  <ul>
    {notDetermined.map((entry) => (
      <li data-not-determined398={entry.id}><strong>{entry.label}:</strong> non determinato — <span>{entry.reason}</span></li>
    ))}
  </ul>
</section>
<style>
  .fiscal-examples398{margin:32px 0}.fiscal-examples398 .fiscal-example398{border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:14px;padding:16px;margin:16px 0}
  .fiscal-examples398 h4{margin:0 0 6px}.fiscal-examples398 p{line-height:1.6}.fiscal-examples398 table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse}
  .fiscal-examples398 th,.fiscal-examples398 td{text-align:left;padding:8px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}
  .fiscal-scroll398{max-width:100%;overflow-x:auto}.fiscal-scroll398 table{min-width:640px}
  .fiscal-examples398 .fiscal-example-meta398,.fiscal-examples398 .fiscal-example-sources398,.fiscal-examples398 .fiscal-example-limit398{font-size:.9rem;color:var(--text-muted)}
  .fiscal-examples398 .fiscal-example-formulas398 code{overflow-wrap:anywhere}
</style>
